Actually "fields being inaccessible on Sobject OpportunityContactRole" on a delete is odd. The most robust fix: rather than reusing/updating the queried OCR record directly (which may carry fields my user can't edit), I should operate only on the fields I need. The safest approach is to **delete all the contact's existing OCRs on that opp and insert exactly one fresh OCR** with the right role — but that still deletes the primary.

The cleaner fix: when exactly one OCR exists and I only need to change `Role`, update a **new sObject with just Id + Role** so no other inaccessible fields are touched.

